      "designer": "Szymon Sznajder",
      "description": "Shelf Round is a humanist sans-serif typeface with a soft, friendly character. It was developed from the structure of Shelf, but its rounded terminals and softened details shift the tone towards warmer, more approachable communication. As a result, it keeps the structure and legibility of the original family while introducing a softer and more recognisable character.\n\nShelf Round was designed for communication that needs to remain clear without feeling cold or anonymous. It can be used in visual identities, branding, product communication, publications and systems where typography needs to build a consistent, friendly tone.",
